    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφ-ευμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marriage, espousal,</i> in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ μητρὸς ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					980
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				365
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in sg.,
				<i>the person married,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλὸν ν. τινί</span> 'a good
			<i>match</i> for him', <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				420
			</span></i>.</div>
